      "text": "Online Ticket Booking System",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Online Ticket Booking System",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NXukiUv3zGUCTe40E-Nda",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64.18939728438852,
      "y": 225.24936973064405,
      "width": 1209.5994873046875,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1183634320,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 568843664,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790644573946,
      "created": 1790636339938,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-Ticket booking Service like BookMyShow, Paytm, District\n- It is a online platform that allows user to purchase tickets of the movies, events etc.\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-Ticket booking Service like BookMyShow, Paytm, District\n- It is a online platform that allows user to purchase tickets of the movies, events etc.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-CH18W2MumqiZ1l9hsL3c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56.18939728438852,
      "y": 353.24936973064405,
      "width": 499.1596984863281,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 409154928,
      "version": 233,
      "versionNonce": 1165322640,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790644571795,
      "created": 1790636485472,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional requirements\n- Search events / movies based on title, location \n  and date\n- View Details of events/movies\n- user should able to do a booking for that events",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Functional requirements\n- Search events / movies based on title, location \n  and date\n- View Details of events/movies\n- user should able to do a booking for that events",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "x3OKEcaPc9HvDonC2xBw7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 739.8694815129041,
      "y": 355.74936973064405,
      "width": 598.1995239257812,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 52673392,
      "version": 431,
      "versionNonce": 1144108944,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790644571795,
      "created": 1790636538317,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non- Functional requirements\n- Scale: 100M users\n- CAP theorem : Highly availability , highly consistence.\nHigh available with respect to searching and viewing an event.\nHighly consistent with respect to booking a particular ticket.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Non- Functional requirements\n- Scale: 100M users\n- CAP theorem : Highly availability , highly consistence.\nHigh available with respect to searching and viewing an event.\nHighly consistent with respect to booking a particular ticket.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VfsuiAE7DKh1dcY3Kk9fd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56.18939728438852,
      "y": 549.249369730644,
      "width": 251.81983947753906,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1964622736,
      "version": 170,
      "versionNonce": 36980112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790644571795,
      "created": 1790644175459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Identify Core Entity\n- Users\n- Events ( movie/concert)\n- Venues (Hall/location)\n- Ticket",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Identify Core Entity\n- Users\n- Events ( movie/concert)\n- Venues (Hall/location)\n- Ticket",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jHEv_dHkNevnU1aSXpLI1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 444.1893972843885,
      "y": 550.249369730644,
      "width": 977.1392822265625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 527893872,
      "version": 341,
      "versionNonce": 591276400,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790644823849,
      "created": 1790644296144,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 API Design\n - GET : /v1/search?q={searchTerm}&location={location}&date={date} ->List<EventId> :Pagination\n- GET : /v1/event/{eventId} -> Event Details & Location & Seats[]\n- POST :/v1/booking/reserve\n            {\n                List<Seat> seats;\n            } ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4 API Design\n - GET : /v1/search?q={searchTerm}&location={location}&date={date} ->List<EventId> :Pagination\n- GET : /v1/event/{eventId} -> Event Details & Location & Seats[]\n- POST :/v1/booking/reserve\n            {\n                List<Seat> seats;\n            } ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
